    "updated_at": "2022-12-03T07:13:04Z",
    "body": "It was added in https://github.com/whatwg/dom/pull/656 and I have to say I regret not pushing back on using \"qualified name\" there. That definitely feels like an oversight. Ideally all new APIs that aim to do tree manipulation operate on local name and namespace only. (Potentially with namespace hidden from the API surface, depending on the needs.)",
